  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">218256_Declaration of humanity by leaders of faith and leaders (DRC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For expenditure data on these and all other World Vision DRC projects, please see the related activity, published by World Vision International (US-EIN-95-3202116-CD)</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project aims to catalyse action by faith leaders communities in Yambio (South Sudan) and Beni (DRC) in line with the key principles of the Declaration of Humanity (DoH). It will utilise religious discussions, educational materials, and other faith community platforms to foster unity between survivors and their communities, and address stigma and support survivors social integration, psychological well-being, and right to justice.</narrative>
  </description>
